Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:51.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master, oh Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.72,0:01:53.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Normally, I can only appear when summoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.48,0:01:56.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,But now that you're unconscious,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.04,0:02:00.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,it seems my chance for freedom has finally come !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.72,0:02:07.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Should I attack him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.96,0:02:11.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,He probably isn't faking it, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.12,0:02:15.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't fall for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.52,0:02:17.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can keep pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.24,0:02:37.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(960,515)}3 days later
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.32,0:02:42.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ah, I can't take it anymore !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.36,0:02:44.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't ever get a better chance than this !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.52,0:02:47.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fuck it, I'll try !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:59.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,When did this guy plant his Divine Sense in me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.68,0:03:00.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:07.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Damn it !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.64,0:03:10.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this how I am supposed to live from now on !?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.68,0:03:22.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I really underestimated the difficulty of merging the 3 Cold Cores.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.36,0:03:25.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,This body simply can't withstand the cold energy released when I try...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.40,0:03:30.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wonder how other cultivators that practiced this method did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.04,0:03:41.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've been guarding you the entire time,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:42.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I swear !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.24,0:03:44.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.32,0:04:06.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's been in closed-door cultivation every day lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.76,0:04:09.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,But forming a Golden Core isn't easy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.76,0:04:12.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The fastest Core Formation in the Burning Fire Country
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.36,0:04:13.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,still took 30 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:18.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.56,0:04:22.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Have you reached a bottleneck ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.36,0:04:27.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Death Spell cultivators need women's Primordial Yin to cultivate...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.68,0:04:29.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,If he...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.44,0:04:32.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.16,0:04:34.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I only agreed to make pills for you !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.36,0:04:35.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,If...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.96,0:04:37.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would rather die than do it !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.16,0:04:44.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why is the Flood Dragon's skull this color ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:47.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Flood Dragon is poisonous,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.52,0:04:50.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's not strange for its bones to turn purple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:54.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,If a Flood Dragon's body contains poison
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.52,0:04:56.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,then how does it avoid being poisoned ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.24,0:04:58.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,When the Flood Dragon was alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.88,0:05:01.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,its flesh, blood, bones, and internal organs
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.56,0:05:03.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,and even its saliva contains poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.64,0:05:05.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,So of course it's immune to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.48,0:05:07.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,A body filled with poison...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.92,0:05:12.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since my body cannot withstand the cold energy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.48,0:05:15.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,that means I need to fill my body with cold energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.56,0:05:17.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's how
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.76,0:05:19.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will be able to withstand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.16,0:05:24.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I reach Core Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.44,0:05:27.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will send you back to the Luo River Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:47.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Most of the Corpse Valley is filled with bones
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:49.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,except for this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:53.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,All is this bone-chilling cold that could freeze my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.88,0:06:03.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can only descend this far for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:05.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I go any further,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.12,0:06:06.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,my body,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.92,0:06:08.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,along with my soul and Divine Sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.04,0:06:10.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,will freeze instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.32,0:06:12.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't leave this valley
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.96,0:06:14.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,until my Cold Cores are merged !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.80,0:06:17.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,After some time passed,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.24,0:06:19.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,the incident of the Fire Spirit Beasts
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:22.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,was solved by a rank 4 country.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.16,0:06:25.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the war between the Burning Fire Alliance and Xuanwu
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.84,0:06:27.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,continued.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.56,0:06:32.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Burning Fire Alliance was able to hold its ground.
