Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.28,0:06:34.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,After some negotiations,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.96,0:06:38.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,the situation finally stabilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.92,0:06:42.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,As for Wang Lin, he was focused on cultivating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.32,0:06:45.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Underworld Ascension Method he cultivates
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.32,0:06:47.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,shouldn't be this difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.40,0:06:54.28,Second,,0,0,0,,Note: 1 zhang = 3 meters
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.40,0:06:49.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,This unprecedented difficulty is due to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.40,0:06:56.12,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(285,567)\fad(1000,500)}After 6 months
