Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.68,0:08:19.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Core embryo is formed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.12,0:08:20.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,To reach Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.52,0:08:22.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just need some spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.56,0:08:25.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I'm not confident
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.60,0:08:27.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,in this final push.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.60,0:08:28.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I fail,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.56,0:08:29.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Core embryo will shatter
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.64,0:08:32.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I'll have to start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.84,0:08:35.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cold energy !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.16,0:08:44.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could this blue flame be the true expression of the Underworld Ascension Method ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.44,0:08:46.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Underworld Ice Flame !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.48,0:09:10.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I never thought I would find more beast bones
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.60,0:09:12.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,this deep underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.64,0:09:14.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are so many Spirit Beast bones
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.56,0:09:17.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I could try making a reaction furnace
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.72,0:09:19.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,to upgrade my flying sword with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.24,0:09:37.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Crafting a reaction furnace is harder than I expected...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.24,0:09:44.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I refuse to believe
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.92,0:09:46.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I can't make one furnace
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.52,0:09:48.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,out of this many bones !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.92,0:10:14.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Still not enough !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.12,0:10:48.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,9 colors !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.60,0:10:52.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, it's only grade 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.84,0:10:54.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,After all my efforts,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.32,0:10:56.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I couldn't make a grade 10 reaction furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.04,0:10:59.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Forget it, this will have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.16,0:11:03.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin didn't know that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.20,0:11:06.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,even the Sect Leader of the War God Shrine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.56,0:11:10.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,only possessed a grade 6 reaction furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.56,0:11:13.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Using a grade 9 reaction furnace to refine his artifact
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.52,0:11:17.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,is extremely efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.24,0:11:35.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.16,0:11:57.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:11.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you swallowed the sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.08,0:12:13.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,where will I live now ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.69,0:12:20.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Note: This is a Flood Dragon's tendon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.76,0:12:21.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.72,0:12:29.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now I just need
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.72,0:12:32.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Heaven Separating Pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.60,0:12:45.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,South Dipper City is one of the 998 cities in the Sea of Devils.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.52,0:12:45.60,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1551,472)}South Dipper City\NSea of Devils
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.04,0:12:49.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,The city is managed by the Punishing Heaven Sect, Soul Extinguishing Sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.24,0:12:53.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the One Heaven Path Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.20,0:13:01.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator, what are you looking for ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.52,0:13:03.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our Treasure Pavilion has everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.44,0:13:04.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's this artifact ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.76,0:13:06.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a defensive bracelet
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.16,0:13:07.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,called the Mist-Born Flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:09.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has an illusion spell
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:10.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,and women love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.28,0:13:21.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why is my cultivation probing failing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:25.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person is fluctuating between Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.60,0:13:27.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,and Foundation Establishment...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.68,0:13:31.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,What does Senior need ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.44,0:13:34.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you sell pill furnaces ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.44,0:13:38.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, in the entire South Dipper City
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:39.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,our Treasure pavilion
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.60,0:13:41.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the only place that sells pill furnaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.36,0:13:44.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please follow me to the second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.12,0:13:47.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Customer,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.64,0:13:49.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,please reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.20,0:13:53.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you buy two, you'll get one for free !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.04,0:14:01.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you're still not satisfied,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.28,0:14:02.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.56,0:14:10.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shopkeeper, the situation is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.20,0:14:12.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Treasure Pavilion has 3 floors
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.24,0:14:14.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,The attendants on the first floor are at Qi Condensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.72,0:14:17.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,On the second floor, this guy is Foundation Establishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.08,0:14:19.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Will the third floor
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.68,0:14:22.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,have a Core Formation cultivator ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.00,0:14:29.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.87,0:14:36.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,this Mysterious Green Pill Furnace was refined over 49 months
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.72,0:14:41.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,using Greenstar Rock and Mysterious Fog Crystal from the depths of the Sea of Devils.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:42.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a grade 3 pill furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.00,0:14:45.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Li Muwan told me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.68,0:14:47.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,she needs at least a grade 4 furnace
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.08,0:14:50.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,to guarantee she can refine the Heaven Separating Pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.52,0:15:03.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I presume fellow cultivator is refining a top quality pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.28,0:15:07.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the Hundred Beasts Pill Furnace, forged from the cores
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.48,0:15:09.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,of 99 low quality beasts
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.28,0:15:11.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,from the Sea of Devils.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.92,0:15:13.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you use it to refine pills,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.40,0:15:16.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,there will be a chance the pills absorbs the energy of a beast's core.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.32,0:15:21.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,The furnace's spiritual energy is leaking when it's closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.44,0:15:24.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,When the seal is opened,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.36,0:15:26.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,this spiritual energy will surge forth !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.28,0:15:32.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Hundred Beasts Spirit Furnace is a grade 5 pill furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.64,0:15:35.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Fighting Evil Sect have been wanting it for a long time
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.32,0:15:37.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,but they lack the funds to buy it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.12,0:15:40.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,so they never did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.76,0:15:42.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's the price ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.08,0:15:46.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,100 000 high-quality spirit stones !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.36,0:15:49.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or you can offer an artifact of similar value.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.64,0:15:53.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,This furnace is indeed extremely expensive...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.52,0:15:56.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,No wonder the Fighting Evil Sect don't have the funds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.92,0:15:59.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator, would you like another ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.88,0:16:01.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Mysterious Green Pill Furnace
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.76,0:16:04.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,is only 10 000 high-quality spirit stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.00,0:16:06.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,It can also be used to make many pills.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.16,0:16:10.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Flood Dragon hide !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.12,0:16:16.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's real hide from a middle rank Spirit Beast, a Flood Dragon !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.40,0:16:18.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,How much of this do you have ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.32,0:16:19.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,How much for the furnace ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.76,0:16:21.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the dragon was 1000 zhang long...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.72,0:16:24.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,the entire hide !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.36,0:16:44.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,We finally managed to sell that Hundred Beasts Pill Furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.92,0:16:46.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Fighting Evil Sect
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.32,0:16:48.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,lacked the funds to buy it yet acted like it was reserved
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.52,0:16:50.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,and scared everyone from buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.00,0:16:54.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since this person has Flood Dragon hide,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.52,0:16:56.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,he should be able to protect that pill furnace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.76,0:17:00.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Trading the Flood Dragon hide will attract attention
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.72,0:17:03.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,but it was necessary...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.08,0:17:06.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I were to trade my spirit liquid
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.36,0:17:08.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,it would be even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.68,0:17:15.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Someone's been watching me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.80,0:17:17.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,since I entered the second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:20.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Besides the one I marked with my Divine Sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.72,0:17:23.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,there are 3 more Core Formation cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:36.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Elder,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.08,0:17:39.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,the guy who traded the furnace just left the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.80,0:17:44.04,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1575,523)}Kun Sang\NFighting Evil Sect Elder\NEarly stage Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.00,0:17:58.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mere tricks !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.16,0:18:15.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,The hunt begins now !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.92,0:18:39.16,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(335,503)}Pu Lin\NFighting Evil Sect Elder\NEarly stage Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.60,0:18:38.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hand over the furnace you bought at the Treasure Pavilion
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.44,0:18:39.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,or die !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.12,0:18:47.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Scram !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.36,0:18:54.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,What kind of flying sword is this !?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:56.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't slightly dodged it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.28,0:18:57.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,to avoid a vital spot,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.00,0:19:00.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would've died just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.44,0:19:09.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such a flying sword
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.68,0:19:10.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,is extremely rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.00,0:19:13.24,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1561,513)}Gu Cheng\NFighting Evil Sect Elder\NEarly stage Core Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.40,0:19:14.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,This kid must have even more artifacts on him !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.84,0:19:26.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it were just one Core Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.68,0:19:28.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I might have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.40,0:19:30.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,But facing three at the same time
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.52,0:19:31.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,is troublesome...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.28,0:19:46.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}I've been walking this path for endless years
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.58,0:19:46.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.56,0:19:52.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is it the compass of fate
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.40,0:19:52.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that wrote this outcome for us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.68,0:19:58.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}The heavens want to erase your existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.56,0:20:04.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that's the obsession guiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.44,0:20:09.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is this the path to uncover
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.32,0:20:09.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}truths from falsehoods ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.04,0:20:15.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}In a world of murk and shadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.94,0:20:15.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}only the flame of truth can light the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.40,0:20:21.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.28,0:20:21.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}being carried by the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.52,0:20:25.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:25.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}being drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.80,0:20:29.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.08,0:20:32.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,300)}I will let the world refine my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.25,0:20:37.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.94,0:20:37.68,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}I will fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.68,0:20:40.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}I'll break through the abyss of despair
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:43.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}to finally learn who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.84,0:20:49.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.72,0:20:49.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,300)}I embrace this obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.20,0:20:52.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.16,0:20:54.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)}Even if this suffering shatters my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.96,0:21:00.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,700)}and I'm reborn countless times in hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.00,0:21:00.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,700)}I'll still fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.64,0:21:03.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}It's hard to avoid loneliness
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.80,0:21:06.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}when you are above everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.84,0:21:12.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.16,0:21:12.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}be afraid of a firefly ?
